Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.52,0:00:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream, one wish If you want it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.02,0:00:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,gotta go over the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Setting sail and heading for the unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Cutting through the\Nwinds and waves as I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep it up, never stopping, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm aiming to get there first, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.96,0:00:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all or nothing. No time to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it later, right now I'm living free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,When your foes look like\Nthey will overwhelm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.54,0:00:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It means your heart's saying\Nthis is what you can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.30,0:00:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite all that to run is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.62,0:01:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they're closed, I\Nfeel the satisfaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm rude,\Nhere's my appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.02,0:01:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,When things are getting\Ntough, just gotta smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.86,0:01:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are going on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're looking for\Na fresh, brand new day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.66,0:01:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then make sure your only\Nthought you have is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.82,0:01:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.34,0:01:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,As you're on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.14,0:01:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Marks maps will be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.42,0:01:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, with every step that you will take.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.28,0:01:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at all you've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look ahead at new horizons.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.22,0:01:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,In view shining brightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.04,0:01:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, who knows what's waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.84,0:01:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Dream living, that's the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.22,0:01:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Make like a hurricane.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.26,0:01:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, got to make your mark today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.10,0:01:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream, one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.06,0:01:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dreams don't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.08,0:01:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for the knockout.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.02,0:01:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Over the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.02,0:02:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.66,0:02:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, a secret mission! Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.46,0:02:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So all we need is a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.12,0:02:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.48,0:02:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,In two weeks' time, we\Nwill head to Onigashima.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.72,0:02:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an island, home to Kaido and\Nthe base of the Beast Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.74,0:02:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,An island? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.22,0:02:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me it's\Nnot on the mainland.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.16,0:02:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,so we have to travel by sea to get to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.26,0:02:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.17,0:02:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortuitously, it's not far.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.70,0:02:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, it's nearly visible from\Nthe land of Wano's shoreline.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.08,0:02:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We will still require a ship,\Nthough not a very large one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.86,0:02:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.77,0:02:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll figure out all those\Nlittle details at a later date.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.98,0:02:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,When do you need all of us ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.20,0:02:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a day in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.82,0:02:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The best time would be the\Nnight of the Fire Festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.72,0:02:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a grand celebration for\Nthe people of the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.96,0:03:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Simply put, Kaido himself\Nis believed to be a deity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.22,0:03:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They think he protects the land,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.56,0:03:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,so Orochi will lead the shogun's\Nprocession to pay tribute that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.60,0:03:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But that is merely a facade.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.78,0:03:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What really takes place is a pretentious\Nbanquet for magistrates and beast pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.20,0:03:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A fine target.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.56,0:03:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Makes a lot of sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.16,0:03:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So we wait till they get wasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.82,0:03:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Use that to our advantage\Nand knock those jerks
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.60,0:03:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,around And then chop the\Nheads off their leaders
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.76,0:03:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.67,0:03:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta give you a quick warning though,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.60,0:03:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Okiku, you'll fall in love after seeing\Nme kick ass. You hear that, sword pervert?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.40,0:03:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Please calm yourself, Sir Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.12,0:03:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not be mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.22,0:03:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a perfectly happy married fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.48,0:03:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Okiku is but a comrade of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.34,0:03:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you that there is\Nno deeper relationship here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.98,0:03:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, your wife as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.80,0:03:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.71,0:03:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw Otsuru?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.63,0:03:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.90,0:03:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Incognito.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.94,0:03:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.85,0:03:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Good to know she's doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.52,0:03:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But I cannot be selfish\Nand go see her yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.66,0:04:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Not until our work is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.08,0:04:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Keen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.48,0:04:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.39,0:04:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a married man!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.64,0:04:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't hog all the ladies!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.54,0:04:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kiku, I'm more\Ndeserving of your attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.70,0:04:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock it off, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.96,0:04:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji, did you know\NKiku's super strong? Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.46,0:04:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Beautiful and a strong warrior?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.94,0:04:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.54,0:04:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, I have designed a symbol\Nto help with getting the word out:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.84,0:04:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,two birds of flame to represent time,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.50,0:04:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,a habu viper to indicate location,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.96,0:04:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and a reverse crescent moon\Nwhich signifies rebellion,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.06,0:04:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,twilight—the second hour of\Nthe bird at fire festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.72,0:04:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It shall take place in Habu Port.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.38,0:04:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,port If that doesn't make sense, it refers\Nto the period between 5.30 and 6.00 p .m.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.64,0:04:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,on your foreign clocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.72,0:04:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fret.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.98,0:04:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This is normal in Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.60,0:04:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.74,0:05:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We will venture out, distributing\Nflyers to anyone bearing the mark,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.22,0:05:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,a moon etched on the left ankle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.16,0:05:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the symbol of insurrection.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.48,0:05:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They are our allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.46,0:05:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There is only one problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.52,0:05:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know how many are out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.74,0:05:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But we've taken steps\Nto maximize our reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.14,0:05:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We have comrades spread about\Nthe country getting the word out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.02,0:05:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Based at the capital, both Sir Zorojuro\Nand Sir Usohachi are aiding us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.36,0:05:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, sorry to say, but I\Ndon't think Zoro's helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.34,0:05:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That aside, Sir Franosuke has disguised\Nhimself as a carpenter's apprentice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.00,0:05:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Having located the craftsman\Nwho designed Kaido's mansion,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.08,0:05:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,we hope to obtain those blueprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.24,0:05:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,They will be essential.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.80,0:05:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting lost is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.84,0:05:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,As for Madam Orochi, she's infiltrated\Nthe walls of Orochi's palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.96,0:05:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Vital to our plan, she's keeping tabs on\Nthe Shogun's forces while entertaining him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.34,0:06:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Rumor has it she's quite popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.66,0:06:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Rocking a geisha get up my heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.36,0:06:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we're together, I wish to\Ndelegate roles to you latecomers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.20,0:06:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Brook, your ability will be essential\Nin helping procure food from the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.54,0:06:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It will?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.60,0:06:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.02,0:06:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Your weather control is like ninjutsu,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.14,0:06:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,so you'll be a kunoichi, Madam Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.64,0:06:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,A female ninja?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.68,0:06:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A kunoichi! Oh, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.32,0:06:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.72,0:06:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.38,0:06:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Sanji's cooking will\Nattract attention and
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.88,0:06:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,also assist us in recruiting\Nothers for our quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.06,0:06:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Following?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.06,0:06:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.82,0:06:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And what about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.14,0:06:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall be paired up with Sir Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.60,0:06:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like for you two, along with\NKiku, to join Dogstorm's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.60,0:06:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cannon, can I dress like a ninja too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.14,0:06:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't see why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.62,0:06:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you know your missions, I shall\Nprovide clothes suited for each of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.38,0:07:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Please kindly take these leaves\Nand place them upon your heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.34,0:07:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.70,0:07:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.96,0:07:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.78,0:07:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Garb-garb-jutsu manifest!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.18,0:07:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.24,0:07:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.80,0:07:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.26,0:07:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Ninja!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.54,0:07:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You may go about your missions,\Nsince you are in the correct attire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.40,0:07:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up, Kin'emon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.76,0:07:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't a real ninja outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.28,0:07:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,On the contrary.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.66,0:07:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the ideal look!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.50,0:07:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you're lying to my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.56,0:07:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Moving on, allow me to summon\Na guide, a real Kunoichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.48,0:07:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.90,0:07:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if she's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.70,0:07:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't wait to meet her! Shinobu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.68,0:08:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I heed your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.20,0:08:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew my outfit was off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.94,0:08:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What a joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.66,0:08:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.96,0:08:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This is really bad! He's shaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.28,0:08:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he's in shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.30,0:08:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon, you want to explain this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.94,0:08:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The world of Kunoichi is divided in two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.10,0:08:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Either sexy or frumpy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.66,0:08:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can pull this up, I'll deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.42,0:08:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking good, Brooke.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.74,0:08:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.44,0:08:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I assumed I was a man\Nwith panties on his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.06,0:08:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But come to think of\Nit, now I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.66,0:08:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.04,0:08:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How nice to be so young\Nand full of spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.50,0:08:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You all may call me Shinobu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.74,0:08:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,In the past, I was like a\Nlittle sister to Master King.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.74,0:09:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Alas, that was long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.66,0:09:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I specialize in seduction jutsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.46,0:09:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.22,0:09:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for Nami's outfit,\NI'd be a broken man right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.78,0:09:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.42,0:09:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I do understand, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.94,0:09:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing is more deadly\Nthan a mature woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.14,0:09:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.22,0:09:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall split up until our\Nforces are all gathered.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.94,0:09:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Take note of three samurai in\Nparticular we hope to recruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.64,0:09:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Finding them will be a tremendous help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.10,0:09:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They are Kawamatsu,\NAshida Doji, and Denjiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.36,0:09:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Much like your present company,\Nthey too once served Lord Odin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.10,0:09:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.50,0:09:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Best of luck with your objectives.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.84,0:09:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We are closing in on our wretched targets.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.00,0:09:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shogun Orochi and Kaido 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.06,0:09:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The fire festivals in two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.30,0:10:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the execution date.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.06,0:10:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll storm Kaido's base on Onigashima and\Nreturn this nation to its former glory!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.22,0:10:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.30,0:10:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.42,0:11:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.00,0:11:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't keep the good stuff to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.66,0:11:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You got to share.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.60,0:11:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.66,0:11:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy Toto brought us that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.44,0:11:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We may never see riches like\Nthis again. I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.34,0:11:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.66,0:11:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.57,0:11:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got sake, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.16,0:11:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This is fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.30,0:11:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Awful greedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.70,0:11:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.88,0:11:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My grandson is so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.88,0:11:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.38,0:11:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just die already!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.60,0:11:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.48,0:11:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.50,0:11:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody's got a fat head.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.34,0:11:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell would pull\Noff a heist like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.60,0:11:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Acting like some hero and\Ngiving food to the poor?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.26,0:11:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,They're selling you\Nhope when there is none.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.10,0:11:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You get your food, then\Nyou lose it just as fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.06,0:11:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Slipping through your fingers\Nlike it was just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.90,0:12:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no samurai here who will\Nstand up for the downtrodden.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.68,0:12:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They all lost their spines.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.60,0:12:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no one left to lead them either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.86,0:12:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No men with honor or\Nconviction or an ounce of guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.82,0:12:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no one left to\Nkeep this ship on course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.70,0:12:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The land of Wano is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.14,0:12:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You all know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.52,0:12:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear that, you old hag?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.88,0:12:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're holding on to\Nlife for no damn reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.04,0:12:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,All you're gonna see is more\Nsuffering and more senseless cruelty!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.90,0:12:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I put you out of your misery?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.86,0:12:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Please run! Grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.14,0:13:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in Lady Odoki's\Nwords, and I always will.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.94,0:13:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.85,0:13:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She's long dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.58,0:13:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The nine samurai will return to this land,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.56,0:13:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and Lord Odin's dream will\Nsurely be fulfilled. Yeah? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.26,0:13:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could take Odin's place?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.54,0:13:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could lead their revolt?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.96,0:13:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Shitenmaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.87,0:13:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, this is bad! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.56,0:13:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.47,0:13:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So, we meet at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.70,0:14:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The head of the Thieves Brigade. Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.36,0:14:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing's a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.48,0:14:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A pirate named Straw Hat Luffy came\Naround here recently. Seen anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.22,0:14:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If I tell you I don't know him,\Nwill you turn around and leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.84,0:14:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.00,0:14:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch your tongue, thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.50,0:14:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lucky,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.50,0:14:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido wants you as part\Nof his crew because if it
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.74,0:14:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,was up to me I would have\Nstomped you out long ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.14,0:14:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,so if you think I owed you even an\Nounce of respect, you're mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.48,0:14:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, if you hate me so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.50,0:14:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've only got one answer for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.12,0:14:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Real quick, Kin'emon,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.70,0:15:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand your strategy so far but\Nthere's one thing I'm still confused about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.48,0:15:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Odin brought down Ashura\NDoji 20 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.78,0:15:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, but you also said he's\Nthe one samurai we need to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.00,0:15:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He fought Odin but he's loyal to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.26,0:15:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A fair question to ask, I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.02,0:15:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.38,0:15:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ashida Doji was defeated,\Nthen mended his ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.94,0:15:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He pledged loyalty to Lord\NOdin when he saw his worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.14,0:15:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But now...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.56,0:15:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that he's doing\Nwicked deeds once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.96,0:15:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Shutenmaru, he's called.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.44,0:15:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the leader of the\NAtamayama Thieves Brigade.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.80,0:15:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I've heard that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.08,0:15:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.18,0:15:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he really strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.46,0:15:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.37,0:15:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Have no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.36,0:15:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, he may be the\Nstrongest samurai of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.12,0:16:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.36,0:16:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.02,0:16:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Samurai aren't so weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.86,0:16:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.48,0:16:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.00,0:17:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Back away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.48,0:17:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Jack is letting loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.48,0:17:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This is going to get ugly!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.88,0:17:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all doomed, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.92,0:17:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.64,0:18:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since he died, I've\Nlost any reason to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.30,0:18:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I've long since been ready to follow him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.34,0:18:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.06,0:18:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting killed by an underling\Nlike you is not the answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.90,0:18:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut the crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.48,0:18:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have died
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.66,0:18:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,together with living
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.08,0:19:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,is suffering I'm so sick of it all
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.66,0:19:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.22,0:19:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.82,0:19:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.84,0:19:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.34,0:19:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.66,0:19:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The sky! Look up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.96,0:19:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.92,0:19:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He came in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.82,0:20:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What could kind of be plotting?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.80,0:20:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Those clouds came out of\Nnowhere—guess it's gonna rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.52,0:20:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.60,0:20:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Hat, get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.56,0:20:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,here
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.56,0:20:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.38,0:20:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.68,0:20:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.98,0:20:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.80,0:20:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.62,0:20:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I will explain the details\Nlater, but this is no illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.38,0:20:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,His body can change forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.80,0:20:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Of all cursed things, the\Npoor boy has become a dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.96,0:20:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.46,0:20:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.38,0:21:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Run! Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.24,0:21:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What does he want?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.60,0:21:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.60,0:21:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.10,0:21:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.72,0:21:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Find those punks and bring them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.12,0:21:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Step on it or else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.98,0:21:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.30,0:21:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.16,0:21:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This couldn't get any worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.12,0:21:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That dragon...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.08,0:21:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,is Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.14,0:21:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.84,0:21:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.68,0:22:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Kaido was a dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.74,0:22:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.52,0:22:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the opponent that we face.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.02,0:23:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A brutal warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.02,0:23:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Who can transform into a beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.40,0:23:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he going in to Okapore?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.72,0:23:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder, what could have brought\Nhim to Kuma all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.66,0:23:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Kin'emon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.06,0:23:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We were identified by them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.94,0:23:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, Straw Hat, and Zoro as well. You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.34,0:23:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But they only know that\Nwe're here in Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.80,0:23:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't know about the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.68,0:23:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that supposed to be reassuring?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.52,0:23:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you screw this up so bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.30,0:23:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You Straw Hats can't stick\Nto a plan to save your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.32,0:23:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have to take that from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.68,0:23:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It was Luffy's fault, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.80,0:23:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Law. Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.20,0:23:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So given the timing, Kaido's probably\Nlooking for me and Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.42,0:24:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The Beast Pirates have an\Noverwhelming presence here thanks to
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.64,0:24:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,two key resources they put all\Ntheir strength into producing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.86,0:24:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,First, there are the weapons that Kaido\Nis forcing the citizens to manufacture.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.68,0:24:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Second, there are the smiles\NKaido uses to fortify his troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.22,0:24:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the artificial devil\Nfruits made by Caesar and Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.26,0:24:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But, as you know, we cut\Nthat off at the source.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.24,0:24:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,After capturing Caesar and\Ndestroying his lab on Punk Hazard,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.72,0:24:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,any further smile\Ndevelopment was shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.34,0:24:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, we destroyed\NDoflamingo's factory and Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.84,0:24:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,shut down production and trade\Ndistribution of smile in no time now
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.52,0:24:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,kaido's business partner is not\Nonly dethroned but locked in prison
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.24,0:24:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,so in the simplest terms possible\Nwe picked a fight with kaido
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.52,0:25:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The Samurai aren't even on his radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.48,0:25:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just after me and Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.08,0:25:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.40,0:25:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going? Sir Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.16,0:25:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay here! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.26,0:25:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They know about the two of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.98,0:25:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,but they don't know that the\Nrest of our crews are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.78,0:25:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to stay out of\Nsight to keep that a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.96,0:25:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, they'll hunt us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.80,0:25:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is obviously bad, but\Nlet's work with what we've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.32,0:25:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hawkins doesn't know much.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.24,0:25:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Continue with your plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.22,0:25:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.13,0:25:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, but what about you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.74,0:25:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could let things be,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.24,0:26:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but Straw Hat's already gotten involved\Nwith the people of this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.36,0:26:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If he can't control his\Nemotions, our plan will fail!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.40,0:26:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.31,0:26:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We need the entire alliance with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.66,0:26:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the only way we can succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.62,0:26:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.68,0:26:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,pull this together somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.04,0:26:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, room.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.95,0:26:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,In the meantime, stay out of sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.16,0:26:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It shambles.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.72,0:26:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.90,0:26:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.16,0:26:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We weren't apart that\Nlong. What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.52,0:27:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thieves Brigade, retreat to the forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.10,0:27:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't want to get in a tussle with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.56,0:27:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard many a tale, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.10,0:27:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,of the mighty brigandous underlings\Nliving deep in the mountains of Khuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.80,0:27:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have changed your\Nname, but I remember you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.34,0:28:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all in the past, though, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.50,0:28:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Just bow down to me, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.30,0:28:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to wipe the\Nslate clean between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.16,0:29:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that stinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.52,0:29:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido, don't tell me you're drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.92,0:29:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.83,0:29:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, Big Dummy?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.00,0:29:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.66,0:29:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's super drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.04,0:29:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it gonna be, Shetemura?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.80,0:29:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't run!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.58,0:29:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to create an opening!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.90,0:29:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to stop the bleeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.80,0:29:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't move, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.30,0:29:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but Commander Kaido is wasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.22,0:29:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no telling how\Nmuch damage he might do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.68,0:29:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're saying we gotta get\Nout of here or we're all dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.80,0:29:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a possibility, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.32,0:29:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about the\Npeople of Okamori Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.18,0:30:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We need them to work in the factories.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.42,0:30:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine if Kaido\Nwants to set an example,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.36,0:30:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,but he can't just wreak\Nhavoc all over Kuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.90,0:30:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna wipe out his own men.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.62,0:30:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't think to share\Nthat important detail with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.40,0:30:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.50,0:30:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Master Keen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.54,0:30:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You return to Odin's palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.56,0:30:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to rescue Saru. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.12,0:30:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm responsible as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.22,0:30:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.48,0:30:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have taken another\Nhusband to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.04,0:30:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty long years.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.58,0:30:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You waited all this time for my return?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.26,0:30:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Saru, I shall make you wait no longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.28,0:30:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, it's still a long way.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.74,0:30:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Right behind you, Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.40,0:30:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Traffy, you think the\Npeople of Okoborre Town are okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.32,0:30:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They'd be a hell of a lot better if\Nsome pirate didn't decide to play hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.38,0:30:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind your own business next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.00,0:30:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's us Kaido wants, not them, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.50,0:30:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.92,0:31:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Supreme Commander, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.12,0:31:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it he?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.78,0:31:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the headliners?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.46,0:31:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, I assume that you're searching\Nfor Straw Hat Luffy and Trafalgar Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.36,0:31:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I have found them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.72,0:31:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They're tucked away in\Nthe ruins of Odin Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.66,0:31:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Baton Kasseler.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.36,0:31:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hawkers...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.27,0:31:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.48,0:31:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They've been hiding in those ruins\Nunder our noses and we didn't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.80,0:31:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.12,0:32:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I said it is a means of redirecting\Nhis rampage. For a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.52,0:32:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,However, this should work to our favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.90,0:32:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,there is an old legend\Nattached to that castle
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.58,0:32:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and because of it people\Nare claiming that they've
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.88,0:32:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,seen an eerie light there\Nthey still believe that
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.90,0:32:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,that the kozuki samurai\Nwill come back for revenge
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.28,0:32:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,from beyond the grave just\Nin time for the anniversary
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.90,0:32:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,huh indeed which i'm\Ncertain has become a great
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.24,0:32:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,cause of stress for the\Nshogun so destroying that
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.56,0:32:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Castle would kill two\Nbirds with one stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.34,0:32:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Old Odin castle, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.42,0:32:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That brings back memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.10,0:32:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a fine hiding place indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.24,0:33:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.92,0:33:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're thinking punks can get\Naway with what you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.22,0:33:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking my smile fruits away didn't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.78,0:33:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You awoke by wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.98,0:33:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell, why is he\Ngoing toward the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.40,0:33:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.80,0:33:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is it just me or is\Nhe coming straight for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.20,0:33:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.12,0:33:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But how did he notice\NI was from so far away?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.64,0:33:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.40,0:34:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's just making a circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.86,0:34:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.40,0:34:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.02,0:34:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Run! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.42,0:34:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he headed straight for the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.30,0:34:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.80,0:35:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Not that!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.58,0:35:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.42,0:35:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.28,0:35:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Last breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.04,0:36:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.46,0:36:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.98,0:37:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido!
